# Ignore vendored third-party C libraries from GitHub language statistics
src/esp_codec_dev/** linguist-vendored
src/tca9554/** linguist-vendored
src/axs15231b/** linguist-vendored

# Treat all C headers as C++ by default since this is an Arduino/PlatformIO project
